 ["We measure short lengths in centimetres (cm), longer ones in metres (m) and very long distances in kilometres (km).","1 metre is 100 centimetres and 1 kilometre is 1000 metres.","Choose the right unit: a pencil in cm, a room in m and a road trip in km."],
